    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><em>And I will strike down upon thee with great vengeance and furious anger.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Domain: </strong>Once per turn when an enemy scores a critical hit against you&nbsp;<em>or</em> one of your nearby allies or drops you or one of your nearby allies to 0 hp or below, you gain an attack-reroll blessing. Immediately choose a nearby ally and give them the blessing as a free action; you can&rsquo;t hold on to it.</p>\n<p>An ally with this blessing can use it to reroll an attack as a&nbsp;free action this battle. An ally can only have one such blessing on them at a time.</p>\n<p><strong>Domain Spells:&nbsp;</strong>Hammer of Retribution, Eyes of the Judge, Compel Duel, Banishment</p>"
    },
